The ideal candidate should have a strong foundation in backend development, database management, and web application development. The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, maintaining, and optimizing scalable web-based applications while ensuring code quality, performance, and reliability. &nbsp; 

This role requires someone with good problem-solving abilities, a willingness to learn, and the ability to collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams. &nbsp; 

