Preferred Skills (Good to Have)&nbsp; 

- Experience with Entity Framework / Entity Framework Core and LINQ. &nbsp; 
 - Knowledge of Microsoft Azure or other cloud platforms. &nbsp; 
 - Exposure to microservices architecture. &nbsp; 
 - Understanding of application security and secure coding practices. &nbsp; 
 - Experience working on enterprise-level or SaaS-based applications. &nbsp; 

What We're Looking For&nbsp; 

- Strong analytical, logical, and problem-solving abilities. &nbsp; 
 - Good understanding of software development fundamentals. &nbsp; 
 - Ability to independently handle assigned development tasks. &nbsp; 
 - Strong debugging and troubleshooting skills. &nbsp; 
 - Attention to detail and commitment to code quality. &nbsp; 
 - Good communication and interpersonal skills. &nbsp; 
 - Ability to work collaboratively in a fast-paced product development environment. &nbsp; 
 - Willingness to learn, adapt, and work with evolving technologies. &nbsp; 

Education&nbsp; 

Bachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, Engineering, or a related technical discipline is preferred. &nbsp; 

Why Join iZOOlogic?&nbsp; 

- Opportunity to work on enterprise-grade cybersecurity products and technology solutions. &nbsp; 
 - Exposure to real-world application development in the cybersecurity domain. &nbsp; 
 - Collaborative and growth-oriented engineering environment. &nbsp; 
 - Opportunities to enhance technical expertise and work with modern development technologies. &nbsp;

